Package: knewsr
Title: Preprocessing and Basic Text Mining for Korean News
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
  person("Jaeseong", "Choe", email = "cjssoote@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects Korean news from the 'Naver' News Search API and RSS or
    Atom feeds, reads news files (Excel, CSV, JSON) including exports from
    'BigKinds' <https://www.bigkinds.or.kr/>, automates their preprocessing and
    computes basic text statistics: term and
    document frequencies, TF-IDF, sparse document-term matrices, n-grams,
    co-occurrence, keyness between groups and term trends over time.
